WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,080
I will lead the team

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:02,400
Everyone, follow me

3
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:04,520
Use defensive talents to shield the front row

4
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,680
Enter the building from the auxiliary station at the back

5
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:13,660
I will never take risks myself. Who knows where the robbers are?

6
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:15,300
Do you have the talent to return to investigation?

7
00:00:15,890 --> 00:00:19,470
Or something is wrong with a self-preservation lunatic like that post-00s generation?

8
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:22,030
I'll take the person away immediately

9
00:00:22,670 --> 00:00:24,950
Are all the people in the building going to be killed?

10
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:28,090
Are there some innocent people among them?

11
00:00:28,090 --> 00:00:30,090
How can I have the time to distinguish between good and bad at this time?

12
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:31,450
Just like just now

13
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,420
If we don't have the first time

14
00:00:33,420 --> 00:00:34,700
Kill those people at the door

15
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:37,250
Just in case one of them has talent

16
00:00:37,730 --> 00:00:39,010
What can we do if it hurts us?

17
00:00:39,640 --> 00:00:40,560
Same now

18
00:00:41,260 --> 00:00:42,660
Compared to one or two injustices

19
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,340
possible good people

20
00:00:45,530 --> 00:00:47,930
Of course, our own safety is more important
